{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Smith & Dungeon: Crafting the Legendary Weapons",
    "steam_appid": 3402300,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402300/extras/6d1fdcf4503b7321d826e0539e975fef.avif?t=1751520992\" width=616 height=250 /></span>&quot;Smith and Dungeon&quot; is a hack-and-slash roguelite game, where you play as a blacksmith exploring dungeons, battling monsters, collecting materials, and crafting powerful weapons!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kingdom announced a grand reward for anyone who could craft a powerful weapon worthy of equipping the hero and their companions on their mission to defeat the Demon King. Only weapons approved by the king would be rewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon hearing this, a young blacksmith, dreaming of fame and fortune, resolved to create the ultimate weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I want to craft weapons capable of defeating the Demon King with my own hands!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To achieve this, he set out to explore dangerous dungeons under the Demon King's control, searching for rare materials to forge a weapon so powerful that it would prove its worth to the king.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thus, his perilous journey into the dungeons began!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft a Variety of Weapons and Armor Using Gathered Materials!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness rare materials collected in dungeons to showcase your skills as a blacksmith! Craft weapons like swords, spears, and bows, as well as armor, helmets, shields, and rings. Equip your crafted gear to enhance your character and prepare for epic adventures!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Dungeons that Change Every Time You Play!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of roguelite gameplay with dungeons that generate random layouts, monster spawns, and treasure chest locations every time you enter. No two runs are ever the same!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recruit Adventurers from the Guild to Form a Party!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the town guild to enlist warriors, archers, mages, and other adventurers with diverse abilities. Assemble a party of up to two companions to battle monsters and collect rare materials in the dungeon!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enhance Abilities to Help Your Character Grow!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your character by upgrading Abilities that boost parameters or unlock new crafting skills. Strengthen your character and master the art of crafting weapons and armor!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Change the Look of Your Character with Equipped Gear!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipping weapons and armor changes the look of your character, allowing for full customization. Create your unique hero for every adventure!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402300/extras/6d1fdcf4503b7321d826e0539e975fef.avif?t=1751520992\" width=616 height=250 /></span>&quot;Smith and Dungeon&quot; is a hack-and-slash roguelite game, where you play as a blacksmith exploring dungeons, battling monsters, collecting materials, and crafting powerful weapons!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kingdom announced a grand reward for anyone who could craft a powerful weapon worthy of equipping the hero and their companions on their mission to defeat the Demon King. Only weapons approved by the king would be rewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon hearing this, a young blacksmith, dreaming of fame and fortune, resolved to create the ultimate weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I want to craft weapons capable of defeating the Demon King with my own hands!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To achieve this, he set out to explore dangerous dungeons under the Demon King's control, searching for rare materials to forge a weapon so powerful that it would prove its worth to the king.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thus, his perilous journey into the dungeons began!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft a Variety of Weapons and Armor Using Gathered Materials!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness rare materials collected in dungeons to showcase your skills as a blacksmith! Craft weapons like swords, spears, and bows, as well as armor, helmets, shields, and rings. Equip your crafted gear to enhance your character and prepare for epic adventures!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Dungeons that Change Every Time You Play!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of roguelite gameplay with dungeons that generate random layouts, monster spawns, and treasure chest locations every time you enter. No two runs are ever the same!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recruit Adventurers from the Guild to Form a Party!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the town guild to enlist warriors, archers, mages, and other adventurers with diverse abilities. Assemble a party of up to two companions to battle monsters and collect rare materials in the dungeon!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enhance Abilities to Help Your Character Grow!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your character by upgrading Abilities that boost parameters or unlock new crafting skills. Strengthen your character and master the art of crafting weapons and armor!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Change the Look of Your Character with Equipped Gear!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipping weapons and armor changes the look of your character, allowing for full customization. Create your unique hero for every adventure!</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Smith and Dungeon&quot; is a hack-and-slash roguelite game, where you play as a blacksmith exploring dungeons, battling monsters, collecting materials, and crafting powerful weapons!",
